OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's 120-mile walk honours
OL,4,Amurdered loved ones
OL,5,
OL,6,FFather and daughter John and Amy Hunt
OL,7,Fare setting out on a 120-mile charity
OL,8,Fwalk to help find "a semblance of
OL,9,Fmeaning" in their world after the
OL,10,Fmurders of John's wife Carol and
OL,11,Fdaughters, Louise and Hannah.
OL,13,FBBC racing commentator John, said the
OL,14,Fwalk will begin at home on Saturday and
OL,15,Fend about a week later in Bournemouth -
OL,16,Fa place "cherished" by the family.
OL,18,FKyle Clifford, Louise's former partner,
OL,19,Fmurdered the women at the family home
OL,20,Fin Bushey, Hertfordshire, in July 2024.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
