OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's 120-mile walk honours
OL,4,Amurdered loved ones
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmy said after the deaths, there was "a
OL,7,Fdarkness in our lives that belonged to
OL,8,Fthe perpetrator" and added the walk was
OL,9,Fpart of their determination to "show
OL,10,Fthe world how wonderful mum and Hannah
OL,11,Fand Louise are and were".
